!CHECK 234632.00 | 000010.70 80 020000.24 D0 | line 5 ST(DU,16,8),$L+0.56,0 (printed "ST(CU"; h2 byte prints "DC")
!CHECK 234633.00 | 232615.13 80 234650.74 00 | line 7 BZB,PNSLIN+POAS,PMES2
